@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title MeTTa rewrite-analysis evidence and mutation boundary
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Immutable normalized evidence" #F8F9FA {
  component "Mode-B MeTTa CPG\nrule Functions + AST + DFG" as CPG #DBE4FF
  component "Flat preorder terms\nheap Enter/Exit tasks" as FLAT #FFF3BF
  component "Exact root discrimination\ndouble-array trie + wildcard" as INDEX #FFE8CC
  component "Dependency pairs\nexact iterative unification" as DP #C3FAE8
  component "Shared iterative SCCs\npolynomial reduction pair" as TERM #E5DBFF
  component "Renamed critical overlaps\ntwo-sided BFS joinability" as CRIT #FCC2D7
  component "Qualified immutable results\nproof, witness, conflict, issues" as RESULT #D3F9D8
}

package "Explicit caller mutation" #FFF9DB {
  component "Validate every endpoint\nas an existing rule" as VALIDATE #FFE8CC
  component "connect_unique" as CONNECT #FFF3BF
  database "Same node set\n+ RewriteDep edges" as OVERLAY #FCC2D7
}

CPG --> FLAT : typed semantics only
FLAT --> INDEX : exact LHS roots
FLAT --> DP : RHS subterms
INDEX --> DP : candidate rule ids
DP --> TERM : RewriteDependency projection
FLAT --> CRIT : rule pairs and positions
TERM --> RESULT : Terminates / witness / Unknown
CRIT --> RESULT : conflicts + status
RESULT --> VALIDATE : optional materialization
CPG --> VALIDATE : endpoint membership and type
VALIDATE --> CONNECT : all endpoints valid
CONNECT --> OVERLAY : append 2 kinds

note bottom of FLAT #F1F3F5
Term depth and continuation depth live on the heap.
No analyzer reparses retained source text.
end note

note bottom of RESULT #FFE3E3
Caps, malformed rules, and non-left-linear
confluence input remain explicit qualifications.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF> | normalized shared-node CPG |
|<#FFF3BF> | stack-safe flat representation/work |
|<#FFE8CC> | exact index or validation boundary |
|<#C3FAE8> | dependency-pair topology |
|<#E5DBFF> | SCC/reduction-pair decision |
|<#FCC2D7> | critical-pair or optional overlay |
|<#D3F9D8> | immutable qualified result |
endlegend
@enduml
